  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-5-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula:",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) \\(\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{3x+4}{x^2+1}\\,dx\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/4}x\\cos(2x)\\,dx\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Separo en dos integrales: una casi logarítmica y otra de arcotangente.</p>\\[\\int\\frac{3x+4}{x^2+1}\\,dx=\\frac32\\int\\frac{2x}{x^2+1}\\,dx+4\\int\\frac{dx}{x^2+1}\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\dfrac32\\ln(x^2+1)+4\\,\\mathrm{arctg}\\,x+C\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i>, con \\(u=x\\), \\(dv=\\cos(2x)\\,dx\\): \\(du=dx\\), \\(v=\\frac12\\mathrm{sen}(2x)\\).</p>\\[\\int x\\cos(2x)\\,dx=\\frac x2\\mathrm{sen}(2x)-\\int\\frac12\\mathrm{sen}(2x)\\,dx=\\frac x2\\mathrm{sen}(2x)+\\frac14\\cos(2x)\\]\\[\\int_0^{\\pi/4}x\\cos(2x)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac x2\\mathrm{sen}(2x)+\\frac14\\cos(2x)\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi/4}=\\left(\\frac\\pi8+0\\right)-\\left(0+\\frac14\\right)\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\dfrac\\pi8-\\dfrac14\\approx0{,}143\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
