   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Director de \\(r\\): \\((2,-1,0)\\times(2,1,-4)=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&-1&0\\\\2&1&-4\\end{vmatrix}=(4,8,4)\\parallel(1,2,1)\\). Con \\(x=0\\): \\(y=-5\\), \\(z=-3\\). Así \\(r\\equiv(t,\\,-5+2t,\\,-3+t)\\).</p><p><b>Plano perpendicular a </b>\\(r\\)<b> por </b>\\(P\\)<b>:</b> \\(x+2y+z+D=0\\); \\(1+0-2+D=0\\iff D=1\\): \\(x+2y+z+1=0\\).</p><p><b>Corte con </b>\\(r\\)<b>:</b> \\(t+2(-5+2t)+(-3+t)+1=0\\iff6t-12=0\\iff t=2\\): \\(M(2,-1,-1)\\).</p><p>La perpendicular a \\(r\\) por \\(P\\) es la recta \\(PM\\), con director \\(\\overrightarrow{PM}=(1,-1,1)\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(s\\equiv(1+\\lambda,\\ -\\lambda,\\ -2+\\lambda)\\), \\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(M\\) es el punto medio de \\(P\\) y su simétrico \\(Q\\): \\(Q=2M-P=(4-1,\\,-2-0,\\,-2+2)=(3,-2,0)\\).</p>\\[d(P,Q)=|\\overrightarrow{PQ}|=|(2,-2,2)|=\\sqrt{12}=2\\sqrt3\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":177,\"el\":44,\"p\":[[\"line\",[0.8,-3.4,-2.2],[3.4,1.8,0.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.4,1.8,0.4],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.4,0.6,-2.6],[3.6,-2.6,0.6],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.6,-2.6,0.6],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"line\",[2.184,-0.633,-0.816],[1.924,-0.373,-1.076],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[1.924,-0.373,-1.076],[1.74,-0.74,-1.26],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1,0,-2],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2,-1,-1],\"M\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[3,-2,0],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m07r5b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m07r5b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m07r5b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m07r5b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='288.0' y1='211.1' x2='26.0' y2='39.8' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='39.8' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='92.6' y1='246.0' x2='241.5' y2='18.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='247.5' y='18.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='148.5' y1='119.9' x2='136.5' y2='138.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='136.5' y1='138.4' x2='155.0' y2='150.5' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='120.5' cy='203.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='127.5' y='197.2' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='167.1' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='174.1' y='126.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><circle cx='213.6' cy='60.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='220.6' y='54.8' font-weight='700'>Q</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='23.2' y2='258.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='19.9' y='259.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='8.0' y2='270.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='-0.6' y='274.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='258.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='258.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(Q(3,-2,0)\\) y \\(d(P,Q)=2\\sqrt3\\approx3{,}46\\) unidades</div></div>"
